# The rule-catalogue snapshot is compared byte for byte against JSON generated
# at run time, which always uses LF. Left to its default, Git checks this file
# out with CRLF on Windows and the comparison fails there and only there.
# Text files in this repository are LF on every platform.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
